`s 344(2) the last day of the 60 days after the date of the notice` MEANS
    `period: the last day of a period after` `the date of the notice` 60 Days

-- (3): the notice about a company being wound up. "If in any case where a company is being wound up the Registrar has reasonable cause to believe that (a) ... (b) ... or (c) ..., the Registrar may publish ... a notice"
