-- src:22753 | Registrar may, unless cause to the contrary is previously shown,
-- src:22754 | strike the name of the company off the register, and must publish
-- src:22755 | notice thereof in the Gazette, and on the publication in the Gazette of
-- src:22756 | the notice the company is dissolved; but —
@ref s 344(4) (src:22752-22756)
