-- src:22896 | (ii) the Central Provident Fund Board established under
-- src:22897 | the Central Provident Fund Act 1953; and
@ref s 344A(8)(a) (src:22886-22897)
GIVEN `the company has applied under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 344A(8)(a) the Registrar must ensure that the particulars of the company and of the application are sent to the Inland Revenue Authority of Singapore and the Central Provident Fund Board` MEANS
    IF `the company has applied under subsection (1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "such particulars of the company and of the application mentioned in subsection (1), as the Registrar may determine, is sent to" -- the text names the application mentioned in subsection (1)

